msgid "Yasuko"
msgstr "Yasuko"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "84_Date"
msgid "Hold on a sec, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Kiryu"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "¿Qué ocurre?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "108_Date"
msgid "There's something I need to tell you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "120_Date"
msgid "Couldn't really say it in there."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "132_Kiryu"
msgid "Does it involve Yasuko-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "144_Date"
msgid "You bet. If she found out about this, she'd just end up\\r\ngetting herself into more trouble."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "156_Kiryu"
msgid "Well? What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "168_Date"
msgid "Well... You only just got here so you probably haven't\\r\nnoticed, but the whole town's been kinda on edge lately."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "180_Kiryu"
msgid "Because of Saejima?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "192_Date"
msgid "Partially, I'm sure. But there's more to it than that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "204_Date"
msgid "Word on the street is, Majima and Saejima linked up a few\\r\ndays ago."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Kiryu"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "228_Date"
msgid "Yup. I hear Majima had his boys line the whole damn street\\r\nto keep the cops off Saejima."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "240_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh. So they've already met."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "252_Kiryu"
msgid "Speaking of, Date-san... do you know where I can find\\r\nMajima-san? I need to talk to him as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "264_Kiryu"
msgid "Not just about Saejima. Majima-san might be able to tell me\\r\nmore about the connection between the top police brass,\\r\nJingu, and the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "276_Date"
msgid "The police? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "288_Kiryu"
msgid "Sorry, but I can't say much more than that. Just know that\\r\npeople are gunning for the Tojo."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "300_Kiryu"
msgid "And no matter what's going down, I need to hear Majima-san's\\r\nside of the story."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "312_Date"
msgid "All right. Last I heard, he'd taken root up on the top floor\\r\nof the Millennium Tower. Starting there's your best bet."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "324_Kiryu"
msgid "Great. Thanks, Date-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "396_Kiryu"
msgid "(Can't think of a better place to talk than New Serena.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "408_Kiryu"
msgid "Yasuko-san, there's a bar near here that I used to go to\\r\nback in the day. We can catch our breath there for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "420_Yasuko"
msgid "Okay, I'll follow your lead."
msgstr ""

